{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mientka Publishing Company prices its bestseller Where's Walter? as follows: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7fc55f857a7561a5650547d9e478cbd90a07c86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) =\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}12n, &amp;\\text{if }1\\le n\\le 24\\\\ 11n, &amp;\\text{if }25\\le n\\le 48\\\\ 10n, &amp;\\text{if }49\\le n\\end{matrix}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"240\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of books ordered, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/e/bde1f9f456ce377ba076eb33e1ea30855f603853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> is the cost in dollars of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> books. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> books cost less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> books. For how many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is it cheaper to buy more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> books than to buy exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> books?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c509d3a261e7e83f70d212fbf005329729bb0dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly, the areas of concern are where the piecewise function shifts value.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03c44460e7b534fc744bddd50a9411f461e6f00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(25) = 11\\cdot 25 = 275$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />, we want to find the least value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e760b04a2fb7651285f99b583c34802395fe3bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) &gt; 275$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/5/095b7c3c7b165683e860f08e88196c5fa6132e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/0620130bbc47d064a4d9fb5ac4f143a628f2d523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) = 12n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, so for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e760b04a2fb7651285f99b583c34802395fe3bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) &gt; 275$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5ccbc6f1eed77756a84760ae35a008d5f5f40b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12n &gt; 275$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b600ee4d00366550377ddc64563c3db2a53fd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 22.91$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus, both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/0626c3401dd2b0192afc70c8825027494215207a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=23$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ece448a1996d075309961bd398a7c8afc99a50e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> will be more expensive than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec56fdea420c2e008226942341356429eb31bc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=25$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17b925de444eeb0ed999eac1c581234a6fbd60f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(49) = 10\\cdot 49 = 490$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />, we want to find the least value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195fbf77e5e54a8a1c6ea050cc85d541d6266a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) &gt; 490$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/4260c8fb868b7e07dd5cd773b68aab8f0024430a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 \\le n \\le 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/2/0524c76556a05d5ecc737cfa4cfbbb071fbd9a5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) = 11n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, so for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195fbf77e5e54a8a1c6ea050cc85d541d6266a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(n) &gt; 490$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96c94d9f23072a90e73d524e45fc3bac85538c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11n &gt; 490$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, leading to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/65031ad75c42b1488dd8b6abf442bae3c4f849de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 44.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd34e6f3fe18e8b155496a66d0e1030c1a3d9488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=45, 46, 47, 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" /> will be more expensive than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17013ed1795ae288921390e56850936acc64f31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/02862a062204394731ce24162804f56fa10fa537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 4 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"23\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> where it's cheaper to buy more books, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"19